// ---- VkTextureManager::UploadPendingWireLevels ------------------------------------------
// The five `incomplete`/false exits the investigation named, plus the two that leave an
// entry pending WITHOUT failing (a `continue`) - those are the ones that can starve a draw
// of its texels while still reporting success, so they are counted separately.
